<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-11-22T22:38:33.798Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 22:38:33 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraqi security forces have moved into the militia-held town of Jurf al-Sakhar, deploying Brigade 72 and seizing checkpoints as Kataib Hezbollah begins a phased withdrawal. A power-station explosion in southern Iraq killed at least four people, and Iraqi police arrested officers and suspects linked to oil-pipeline smuggling between Dhi Qar and Basra. Senior ISIS figures were killed in operations in Diyala and northeastern Iraq, while a new Shiite militia, Asa'ib Al-Jihad, announced its formation. The UCDP recorded 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxOdGtDVUVuSFA3aldyV3lnZHhnTlJoYm9pa05NNGgyLU85amVrVmRQTU1SZEJjcUJCVFljM0RzOHc5aVhmOTR2c285RnRpRTI1MWpTOW52TG9tRWkySUNtbFQ2RDcxYnAxcG1Kc3BlUmtPekxkcGZyMk5BdTZNeWhYX0NkNTZoWVUzMU02LVlvUVNnVXJCUndZZzRIbEw?oc=5&quot;&gt;CNN&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxQV2tZeGtYTDZjVXV0UUFUSGlGdk1WT3hPMkVQb0FjaWJRcXBRWjBvdUxKeTZRXzlPenhiQW5uR1ItREg5VTVOWnhMLXhMWElXMmtVQUhxYkR4djVyWXJmSnF0NlVkSWI0MkJYVzBsSW5BSkUxN0MxS1VjVDBXREdZbzVQQW41ZnJxT1A4RjloTU5EN2FCNXA2NXQ3dUhoVEVPYnRKSmxGdDRCdXpqQlprdnd2RkI?oc=5&quot;&gt;Around Prague&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxQUm1fcjB0RWZBQ2pfdWxURjg5OGdWTnVSeE9tSkhqTWFzLUlZVnI2SVBoOFJTUFY1X1BVbjJueEYya0l5dUt5dmh1RTZkSG01cjFEaVNXdmZmaXMyNU04Slc1ZUZWMEk1a3VyQzhFMExpVktlXzhlOVQyMXQ3MzhXMnlFZFRDdE1VWU5MSElZcUd2R0JlU3FLSUhmbzdqN1VCeDhnTlVxZl9PcjQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yeni Safak English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiekFVX3lxTE9PUjhNRG5wT2hKNHZzYjA1b0w1ck8tYVdJeG9CRjVyb3QzcnUzcVNvLUIwQUxzcXl6aFFTOUlScHd